            0.253,
            0.636,
            0.883,
            0.712
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The seasons and length of daytime are reversed in the Southern Hemisphere as compared to the Northern Hemisphere. There, it is winter in June and summer in December (Fig. 12.10 and Fig. 12.11)."
            }
          ]
        },
